  "description": "JSON serialization abstraction layer built on System.Text.Json with Newtonsoft.Json-familiar defaults out of the box: case-insensitive property matching, lenient number/string coercion, CLR-native object deserialization (ExpandoObject instead of JsonElement), relaxed UTF-8 encoding, cycle-safe references, and public field inclusion. Full API for serialize/deserialize to string, stream, and byte array (sync and async), JSON document merging, deep cloning, object population and patching, per-type naming policies via [JsonNaming], empty collection suppression via [JsonIgnoreEmpty], default value handling via [JsonIgnoreDefault]/[JsonDefaultValue], implicit operator value object serialization, and safe Exception serialization. Drop-in migration path from Newtonsoft.Json to System.Text.Json without sacrificing developer ergonomics.",
  "id": "ActDim.Practix.Json",
